# Line endings are part of whether this repository works.
#
# A Windows clone with the default `core.autocrlf=true` gives every shell script CRLF endings,
# and a CRLF shebang inside a Linux container is not a warning: the entry point dies with
# "\r': command not found" and the container restart-loops. The stack is meant to run on macOS
# and Windows as much as on Linux, so the endings are pinned here rather than left to the
# cloning machine's git configuration.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
